meta {
  name: Create Expense
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/_private/v1/expenses
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{authToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "amount": "120.00",
    "currency": "INR",
    "description": "Team Dinner",
    "note": "Dinner at Mainland China",
    "type": "SPLIT",
    "expenseDate": "2026-09-29T20:00:00Z",
    "categoryId": null,
    "groupId": null,
    "splits": [
      {
        "userId": "{{userId}}",
        "amount": "60.00",
        "splitType": "EQUAL",
        "isPaid": true
      },
      {
        "userId": "friend_user_id_here",
        "amount": "60.00",
        "splitType": "EQUAL",
        "isPaid": false
      }
    ]
  }
}

docs {
  # Create Expense (`CreateExpense`)

  **Route**: `POST /api/_private/v1/expenses` (Bearer token required)

  The user comes from your token. Rules the server enforces:
  - `type` is PERSONAL, SPLIT or INCOME. `amount` must be > 0.
  - SPLIT needs `splits`; each user once; split amounts must add up to `amount`.
  - Without `groupId`, you must be the payer and can only split with accepted friends.
  - With `groupId`, you, the payer (`userId`, optional) and everyone in `splits` must be group members.
  - `isSettlement: true` marks a settle-up payment.
  - 400 = bad input, 403 = not allowed.
}
